<div class="row mt-5 mb-5 service-section-block">
    <div class="col-md-10 offset-md-1">
        <div class="frame-service-desc">
            <h3>Day Outs</h3>
            <p class="frame-service-text">
                It is somewhat ironic to realize that the more we try to differentiate our personal and professional lives, the more they cast a shadow on each other. It helps to work better if we know our work family better. Better bonding, reduced employee stress, a chance to know each other better beyond the office timesheets, it all adds up to great fun at work. Our network across the country and abroad helps us get you great destinations and great choices for your team’s day-outs that too at unbeatable prices. For the record, we haven’t disappointed many yet. (Honestly! none)
            </p>
